### Ask Analytics — total spend
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/askAnalytics
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is the total procurement spend?"
}

###

### Ask Analytics — top supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/askAnalytics
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "Which supplier has the highest order value?"
}

###

