###

### Upload a document for RAG
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/uploadDocument
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "filename": "procurement-policy.txt",
    "content": "Travel expenses must be submitted within 30 days of travel. Hotel reimbursement is capped at 5000 INR per night. Flight bookings must be approved 7 days in advance. Vendor payments require dual approval above 5 lakhs."
}

###

### Ask Document — travel policy
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/askDocument
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is the travel reimbursement policy?"
}

###

### Ask Document — vendor payments
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/askDocument
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "When is dual approval required for vendor payments?"
}

###

### Ask Document — hotel limit
POST {{baseUrl}}/chat/askDocument
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "question": "What is the hotel reimbursement limit?"
}

###

### Get Executive Summary
